# The one XL window scripts/automation/xl-run.sh xl runs at the next 02:00
# Sun-Fri slot (4 h, 512 GiB, fem-em-solver-xl; six per trailing 7 days, nightly).
# Lives in docs/testing/ (moved 2026-09-13 so the daily review, whose write
# scope excludes scripts/automation/, can act as XL clerk from
# docs/testing/xl-pending.md). Set by the weekly review, the daily review
# (daily-review.md step 6b) or the operator; cleared by the launcher after the
# run, so a window runs once and is never silently repeated.
#
#   XL_CHUNK   - chunk id, used for the harness log name and the ledger row
#   XL_COMMAND - the command exactly as it would be typed after
#                scripts/testing/run_and_log.sh <chunk>
#
# Empty is the normal state and the nightly entry then exits in a second.

XL_CHUNK=""
XL_COMMAND=""
